    "description": "Welcome home to this sunny, light filled, charming stand alone Victorian home. This beautiful property was extensively rebuilt in 2009 with new systems throughout. This condominium is part of a three unit project with 2 units behind the home. Upon entering one is greeted by a lovely living room with gas fireplace and a large kitchen with Cesar Stone counters,  Bosch appliances and dining area. Enjoy convenient built-in surround sound throughout the home.  There is one bedroom and one bath on this level. The lower level features one bedroom with an en-suite bath and convenient interior entrance to the garage. There is in-unit laundry and a large private storage room. Enjoy the best of Mission living on this quaint street and easy walking to fun restaurants and shops  on 24th Street including Itria, Wise Sons and Beretta on 23rd."
  },
